OL,3,AHundreds attend Jacob Elordi lookalike
OL,4,Acompetition
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people turned out to watch
OL,7,Fa Jacob Elordi lookalike contest which
OL,8,Fsaw youngsters don their finest tote
OL,9,Fbags and slouchy sweatshirts.
OL,11,FThe event, which took place on College
OL,12,FGreen, was organised by Overheard at
OL,13,FUoB - a social media community
OL,14,Fdedicated to life at the University of
OL,15,FBristol.
OL,17,FAcclaimed Australian actor Elordi is
OL,18,Fbest known for his roles in The Kissing
OL,19,FBooth, Saltburn, Frankenstein,
OL,20,FWuthering Heights, Priscilla and the
OL,21,FHBO series Euphoria.
